content.thinking:
Should schema. Should decide all required nested. Should have JSON draft proper. Keep unknown confidence. Schema use $defs: nonEmptyString, id etc. date-time format. `$schema` string const. record_type const "ai_incident_learning_record"; spec_version const "0.1.0"; record_id pattern; reporting_status enum preliminary updated final correction; synthetic boolean; public_summary min 40 perhaps examples satisfy. incident fields title event_class detection_context enum deployment evaluation red_team monitoring third_party other unknown, occurred_at nullable date-time issue anyOf null? use `type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"` valid JSON Schema. discovered_at same required; ongoing boolean/null; timeline array item at event source_id nullable.
entities systems array min1 object system_id role developer/deployer/tool/other unknown names public name optional? `description`, `model_version_public` nullable. Avoid PII no contact.
impacts actual {severity, scope, reversibility, affected_count_estimate integer min0/null, rationale}; potential same.
evidence array items evidence_id kind enum observation log evaluation report external_statement estimate inference other; summary, source_class enum first_party independent third_party anonymous synthetic derived; availability public available_on_request confidential destroyed unknown; uri nullable format uri; supports list IDs? no.
controls array {control_id, description, layer enum prevention detection response recovery governance other, performance enum held degraded failed not_applicable unknown, rationale}
causal_analysis {status enum preliminary stable disputed unknown, contributing_factors array, alternative_explanations array, key_uncertainties array, evidence_that_would_change_assessment}
response {priority enum, immediate_actions array strings, ongoing_risk string}
corrective_actions {action_id, description, owner_role (not personal), status enum proposed in_progress completed verified ineffective abandoned, due_date nullable, verification {method, result nullable, evidence_ids array}}
redactions {field_path, reason enum personal_data security confidential_business legal other, public_interest_note}
extensions object propertyNames pattern `^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*$` additional true.
assessment {actual_severity, potential_severity, preventive_control_performance, response_priority perhaps duplicates impact; perhaps assessment fields include rationales. Already impacts include actual/potential, controls performance and response priority. Avoid duplication by actual in assessment and impacts only descriptors. I'll use `assessment` top-level contains event_class? Keep:
`assessment`: actual_impact object, potential_impact object, preventive_control_performance string, response_priority, rationale? actual/potential each rationale. `preventive_control_rationale`, `priority_rationale`.
record metadata `based_on` previous_record_id nullable.
Source log field `notes` optional.

Examples 3. Should synthetic v1 actual incident privacy perhaps unauthorized action by customer support agent sent incorrect sensitive data? Avoid using real. Example near miss agent broad tool creds attempted transfer blocked approval. Control_signal evaluation discovered sandbox escape route but no deployment exposure. Routine minor wrong action rollback. Should not include procedural harmful details. Vignettes shortened in reviewer scenarios.

I'll write schema and examples in parallel.

